meditate with music or without.\n\nWe\u2019re having a positive effect on more and more people each day. Take a moment to prioritize yourself today, and enjoy the app. ", "short_description": "Mindfulness Meditation XR is the #1 app for mindfulness practice in XR. Discover a happier, more mindful life through our meditation courses set in 360 visualizations of nature, space and art."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.termsfeed.com/live/68ca91d8-c4fb-425b-90e8-3e3ab788f552", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Alex Azzi", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/mxrm/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "810139357995560"}], "external_subscription_type": "REQUIRED_FOR_SOME_CONTENT", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "25131761143119862"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491827718_29252574207721549_7279736092701766298_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=sK4f6LdBGSYQ7kNvwFLenTF&_nc_oc=AdpOKVoQan8_shvVE3-uD6_UOdofC7UacMXzyy2Te9LEn9rj_sW-eJ_OGLp85aHgai8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTR8r6jObpNTSyEsgm20Abr4Q__OKs_E8cvPtkGE1AQGA&oe=6AFC67E9"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "Meditation XR - Mindfulness", "platform": "ANDROID_6D